  "details": "I hope people actually read these. See, i don't get motion sickness and other non-sensitive people like me would Love to have a 3rd person toggle in Virtual Reality. similar to PC / Desktop  there would be a toggle for it in Graphics. And if you're afraid of people with severe motion sickness toggling it on accident you can add an additional Yes Or No warning  to it. I would die for this feature and I'm sure many others would too because it would be really cool to have. And i hate to seem desperate but Please add this.  Anyway, if you can't add it, thanks for at least taking the time to read this. <3",
